ons, workers, tasks and approvals.',1,0,'2026-09-28 16:53:21','2026-09-28 16:53:21'),('01a0e8ef-70db-7193-8990-4c8a7085020c','01a0e8ef-70c9-7076-86d7-e6a5deb3dba8','agronomist','Agronomist','Crop planning, field operations, pests and disease, harvest.',1,0,'2026-09-28 16:53:21','2026-09-28 16:53:21'),('01a0e8ef-70e0-71df-aca7-a6f577414364','01a0e8ef-70c9-7076-86d7-e6a5deb3dba8','livestock_manager','Livestock Manager','Animals, breeding, feeding, health, production and movements.',1,0,'2026-09-28 16:53:21','2026-09-28 16:53:21'),('01a0e8ef-70e1-71d7-8f3f-e7e67697239b','01a0e8ef-70c9-7076-86d7-e6a5deb3dba8','store_manager','Store Manager','Stock, stores, issues, transfers, deliveries. Requests purchases; does not buy or set prices.',1,0,'2026-09-28 16:53:21','2026-09-28 16:53:21'),('01a0e8ef-70ea-72e3-a0db-33bf5bf6fbc4','01a0e8ef-70c9-7076-86d7-e6a5deb3dba8','accountant','Accountant','Income, expenses, invoices, payments, payroll and financial reports. Cannot change operational records.',1,0,'2026-09-28 16:53:21','2026-09-28 16:53:21'),('01a0e8ef-70f0-73f9-b367-c84f884b8d24','01a0e8ef-70c9-7076-86d7-e6a5deb3dba8','field_worker','Field Worker','Executes assigned tasks on mobile. No access to money, stock values or other workers.',1,0,'2026-09-28 16:53:21','2026-09-28 16:53:21');
